ue"></span><p class="absolute right-3 top-3 max-w-[150px] rotate-2 bg-chalk-soft p-2 text-xs shadow" role="note">📌 Hoje: casual</p></div></div><button type="button" class="btn mt-2">Voltar ao quarto</button></div><div class="mirror-controls grid min-w-0 gap-3" data-testid="mirror-controls"><div class="mirror-head"><h2 class="type-h3">Espelho</h2><span class="mirror-head-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Limpar</button></span></div><section class="mirror-section" aria-labelledby="mirror-parts-h"><h3 id="mirror-parts-h" class="mirror-section-h">Partes do look</h3><div class="fitting-stores mirror-parts" role="group" aria-labelledby="mirror-parts-h"><button type="button" class="fitting-store mirror-part" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Parte de cima: Peça a — abrir ações"><span class="mirror-part-art" aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" src="http://localhost:8080/media/a.png"></span><span class="fitting-store-name">Parte de cima</span><span class="mirror-part-caption">Peça a</span><span class="mirror-part-badges"><span class="badge badge-chalk">2D</span></span></button><button type="button" class="fitting-store mirror-part is-empty" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Peça única: Vazio — abrir ações"><span class="mirror-part-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" width="36" height="36" role="img" aria-label="Ilustração de como posicionar a peça"><g class="text-ink"><path fill="var(--surface-2)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" d="M74 30 L90 24 Q100 34 110 24 L126 30 L134 70 L124 84 L140 176 L60 176 L76 84 L66 70 Z"></path></g><g class="guide-camera" transform="translate(150 18)"><rect x="0" y="4" width="30" height="20" rx="4" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></rect><circle cx="15" cy="14" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><rect x="9" y="0" width="12" height="5" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"></rect><text x="15" y="36"